### =========================================================================
### SoukLab Backend HTTP Client Test Suite
### Compatible with VS Code REST Client, Thunder Client, and IntelliJ IDEA.
### =========================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@email = artisan.test@souklab.dz
@password = StrongPassword123!
@accessToken = {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}
@refreshToken = {{login.response.body.data.refreshToken}}

### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 1. AUTHENTICATION & SESSION
### -------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 1.1 Register New Account
# @name register
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Amina Benali",
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}",
  "role": "ARTISAN",
  "phone": "+213555123456"
}

### 1.2 Login (Stores access & refresh tokens)
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### 1.3 Refresh Access Token
# @name refreshToken
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{refreshToken}}"
}

### 1.4 Get Current User Profile (Polymorphic: Artisan vs Client)
# @name getMe
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 1.5 Partially Update Current Profile (RFC 7396 JSON Merge Patch)
# @name patchMe
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bio": "Mise à jour de la biographie: Maître céramiste traditionnelle.",
  "website": "https://amina-ceramique.dz",
  "city": "Beni Yenni",
  "region": "Tizi Ouzou"
}

### 1.6 Verify Email with 6-Digit OTP
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/verify-email
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "code": "123456"
}

### 1.7 Resend Verification Code
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/resend-verification
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}"
}

### 1.8 Request Password Reset OTP
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/forgot-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}"
}

### 1.9 Logout (Invalidates Refresh Token)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 2. ARTISAN DIRECTORY & SEARCH
### -------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 2.1 Directory Search (Unauthenticated -> Expects 403 Forbidden)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/public/directory?page=0&size=10

### 2.2 Directory Search (Authenticated Non-Premium -> Masked Names & Locked Contacts)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/public/directory?keyword=poterie&page=0&size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 2.3 Directory Search with Facet Filters (Wilaya & Minimum Rating)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/public/directory?wilaya=Tizi+Ouzou&minRating=4.0&page=0&size=12&sort=rating,desc
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 2.4 Get Specific Artisan Public Profile (View Count Incremented, Dynamic Contact Gating)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/artisan/artisan-uuid-here
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 3. COMMUNITY FEED
### -------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 3.1 Browse Public Published Posts
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/feed?page=0&size=10

### 3.2 Filter Feed by Type (ACTUALITE / FORMATION / ANNONCE)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/feed?type=ACTUALITE&page=0&size=10

### 3.3 Get Single Feed Post
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/feed/post-uuid-here

### 3.4 Submit Post for Moderation (Authenticated)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/feed
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "ACTUALITE",
  "title": "Nouvelle exposition de céramique kabyle",
  "body": "Rejoignez-nous ce week-end à l'atelier pour découvrir notre nouvelle collection artisanale.",
  "formationId": null
}

### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 4. SUBSCRIPTIONS & CHARGILY CHECKOUT
### -------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 4.1 List Public Active Subscription Plans
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/subscriptions/plans

### 4.2 Initialize Checkout Session (Chargily EDDAHABIYA / CIB)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/subscriptions/checkout
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "planId": "plan-uuid-premium"
}

### 4.3 Check Current User Subscription Status
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/subscriptions/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 5. CATALOG TAXONOMIES (Public Reference)
### -------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 5.1 Get Craft Categories Hierarchy
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/catalog/categories

### 5.2 Get Algerian Wilayas and Dairas
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/catalog/regions

### 5.3 Get Material Families & Materials
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/catalog/materials

### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 6. CONTENT REPORTING (Abuse / Flagging)
### -------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 6.1 Submit Report Against Post / Review / User
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/reports
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "targetType": "POST",
  "targetId": "post-uuid-here",
  "reason": "Contenu inapproprié ou non artisanal",
  "details": "Cet article fait la promotion de produits industriels d'importation."
}
